# Build context for the polygon images (docker/README.md). The context is the
# REPOSITORY ROOT rather than docker/polygon, because the images obtain their nginx
# include by running the installer's own step file — an image that performed that edit
# itself would be asserting a precondition it had manufactured, which is exactly how a
# missing installer step once survived the whole suite.
#
# Everything below is either build output or a dependency tree: none of it is copied
# into any image, and sending it would make the context gigabytes for two small files.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
.git/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
